{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"404","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Marathon"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Valera takes part in the Berland Marathon. The marathon race starts at the stadium that can be represented on the plane as a square whose lower left corner is located at point with coordinates "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the length of the side equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters. The sides of the square are parallel to coordinate axes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As the length of the marathon race is very long, Valera needs to have extra drink during the race. The coach gives Valera a bottle of drink each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters of the path. We know that Valera starts at the point with coordinates "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and runs counter-clockwise. That is, when Valera covers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters, he reaches the point with coordinates "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(a, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":". We also know that the length of the marathon race equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"nd + 0.5"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Valera's coach determine where he should be located to help Valera. Specifically, determine the coordinates of Valera's positions when he covers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d, 2·d, ..., n·d"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated real numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ a, d ≤ 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":", given with precision till "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" decimal digits after the decimal point. Number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" denotes the length of the square's side that describes the stadium. Number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" shows that after each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters Valera gets an extra drink."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n ≤ 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":" showing that Valera needs an extra drink "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" times."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines, each line should contain two real numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":", separated by a space. Numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" in 